      "content": "I'll read the original test and the CUT source in parallel to understand what needs to be improved.Now I have a clear picture. I'll improve understandability by:\n1. Removing the unused `DELTA` constant and unused imports\n2. Extracting the magic numbers `33L` and `42L` as named constants\n3. Adding `@DisplayName` annotations for contextThe improved test compiled successfully. The changes made were: removed the unused `DELTA` constant and unused imports, extracted the magic numbers `33L` and `42L` as named constants `RANGE_START_INCLUSIVE` and `RANGE_END_EXCLUSIVE`, and added `@DisplayName` annotations to clarify the test's intent."
